{"slug":"sh-f-e","ar":"ش ف ع","total":31,"core":"intercession; pairing","forms":[{"ar":"شَفَٰعَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":13,"gloss":"Intercession","word":"shafaah","ex":{"s":74,"a":48,"p":3,"ar":["فَمَا","تَنفَعُهُمْ","شَفَـٰعَةُ","ٱلشَّـٰفِعِينَ"],"en":"So there will not benefit them the intercession of [any] intercessors"}},{"ar":"شَفِيع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"intercessor","word":null,"ex":{"s":30,"a":13,"p":6,"ar":["وَلَمْ","يَكُن","لَّهُم","مِّن","شُرَكَآئِهِمْ","شُفَعَـٰٓؤُا۟","وَكَانُوا۟","بِشُرَكَآئِهِمْ","كَـٰفِرِينَ"],"en":"And there will not be for them among their [alleged] partners any intercessors, and they will [then] be disbelievers in their partners"}},{"ar":"يَشْفَعُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":5,"gloss":"to intercede","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":28,"p":8,"ar":["يَعْلَمُ","مَا","بَيْنَ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","وَمَا","خَلْفَهُمْ","وَلَا","يَشْفَعُونَ","إِلَّا","لِمَنِ","ٱرْتَضَىٰ","وَهُم","مِّنْ","خَشْيَتِهِۦ","مُشْفِقُونَ"],"en":"He knows what is [presently] before them and what will be after them, and they cannot intercede except on behalf of one whom He approves. And they, from fear of Him, are apprehensive"}},{"ar":"شَٰفِعِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"intercessors","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":100,"p":4,"ar":["فَمَا","لَنَا","مِن","شَـٰفِعِينَ"],"en":"So now we have no intercessors"}},{"ar":"شَّفْع","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"even number","word":null,"ex":{"s":89,"a":3,"p":1,"ar":["وَٱلشَّفْعِ","وَٱلْوَتْرِ"],"en":"And [by] the even [number] and the odd"}}],"surahs":[[2,4],[4,4],[6,3],[7,2],[10,2],[39,2],[74,2],[19,1],[20,1],[21,1],[26,1],[30,1],[32,1],[34,1],[36,1],[40,1],[43,1],[53,1],[89,1]]}